  "zipball_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/thierryc/Glyphs-mcp/zipball/v2.3.1",
  "body": "Glyphs MCP 2.3.1 makes development skills an optional part of agent setup and presents existing local development tools positively.\n\n- Add a remembered **Include Glyphs MCP development skills** checkbox for Codex and Claude Code setup.\n- Preserve existing development and release skills while keeping successful connection setup successful.\n- Point to the development skill in the Skills catalog, with English, French and Simplified Chinese copy.\n- Retain the component-update reminders, Beztrace integration and compatibility of 2.3.0.\n\nAfter updating the desktop app, open **Setup** to update the Glyphs MCP component when its card indicates an update. Component installation remains explicit. Existing local development skills are preserved.\n\nDesktop build 69. Glyphs 4 only; Apple Silicon and Intel app architectures. Physical Intel testing remains unavailable; x86_64 qualification uses Rosetta. Beztrace retains its separate Apple Silicon/macOS 26.6.2 requirement.\n"
